    <s:String x:Key="Privacy.recentdocs.Name">Recently opened documents</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Privacy.recentdocs.Expl">Windows keeps the list of files you recently opened, by type.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Privacy.recentdocs.Why">To offer them quickly again in Explorer and applications.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Privacy.runmru.Name">'Run' commands</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Privacy.runmru.Expl">Windows remembers the commands you typed in the Run dialog (Win+R).</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Privacy.runmru.Why">To auto-complete them next time.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Privacy.typedpaths.Name">Paths typed in Explorer</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Privacy.typedpaths.Expl">Windows keeps the paths and addresses entered in Explorer's address bar.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Privacy.typedpaths.Why">For address bar auto-completion.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Privacy.wordwheelquery.Name">Explorer searches</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Privacy.wordwheelquery.Expl">Windows keeps the history of your searches made in File Explorer.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Privacy.wordwheelquery.Why">To suggest your previous searches again.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Privacy.userassist.Name">Launched programs</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Privacy.userassist.Expl">Windows counts and dates the launches of programs you use (UserAssist).</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Privacy.userassist.Why">To rank your most-used apps in the Start menu.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Privacy.lastvisitedpidlmru.Name">Open/Save dialog folders</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Privacy.lastvisitedpidlmru.Expl">Windows keeps the last folders used in 'Open' and 'Save as' windows.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Privacy.lastvisitedpidlmru.Why">To reopen dialogs at the last location used per application.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Privacy.opensavepidlmru.Name">Open/Save files</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Privacy.opensavepidlmru.Expl">Windows remembers files recently opened or saved via dialogs, by extension.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Privacy.opensavepidlmru.Why">To offer them again in 'Open' and 'Save as' windows.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Privacy.recent-jumplists.Name">Recent documents &amp; Jump Lists</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Privacy.recent-jumplists.Expl">Shortcuts to your recent documents and Jump Lists of taskbar applications.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Privacy.recent-jumplists.Why">To show your recent files in Explorer and on right-click of taskbar icons.</s:String>

